   "data": {
    "bull": [
     {
      "text": "Quarterly momentum is accelerating with revenue rising from ₹8,531 Cr in Sep 2025 to ₹10,542 Cr in Jun 2026 and PAT from ₹1,018 Cr to ₹1,559 Cr over the same period.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "The company combines high capital efficiency (ROCE 26%) and expanding profitability (operating margin 18.8% vs 18.2% three years ago) with a conservative balance sheet (debt/equity 0.18) and strong cash conversion (operating cash flow/PAT 1.29x over three years).",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management has a track record of meeting guidance, delivering 4.9% value growth against a mid-single-digit target and maintaining PBDIT margin at 18.8% within the 18-20% band across four quarters.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2025-11-01:p25",
       "T:2025-11-01:p27"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Long-term growth is anemic with a 3-year revenue CAGR of just 1% and PAT CAGR of 1.6%, suggesting structural maturity in the core business.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Forward guidance points to continued modest expansion: management targets only 8-10% volume growth for FY27 with a 4-5% value-volume gap, implying mid-single-digit value growth ahead.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-08-01:p20",
       "T:2026-02-01:p35"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Recent margin outperformance (20.6% PBDIT in one quarter) is early and unproven, with the full-year guidance still anchored at the 18-20% band and only one of four quarters reported.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-08-01:p20"
      ]
     }
